    "detailed_description": "Game features:<br>1. Team up system, 5 banshees can be selected to fight at the same time. As each banshee has different skills, your team members are very important.<br>2. Rich skill system, with more than 100 skills in the game. Each banshee can learn other skills besides her own. So you can match the ever-changing skill combination according to your preference.<br>3. Map exploration. With the improvement of lock level, you can unlock higher level maps to obtain better banshees.<br>4. Divine beast system. Divine beast is not limited by carrying level, but it is not easy to obtain. You need to challenge a difficult task to get it.<br>5. Exchange system. Unwanted skill books can be exchanged for advanced skill books in the store.<br>6. The banshee attribute system has five attributes, including strength, magic, physique, endurance and speed. These attributes are very important for strength improvement.<br>7. Qualification system. The qualification of the banshee also determines her growth. The higher the qualification is, the higher the attribute will be obtained after upgrading.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255480/extras/340e558a4adf5a9484e865ff45a471ed.avif?t=1693084758\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Game features:<br>1. Team up system, 5 banshees can be selected to fight at the same time. As each banshee has different skills, your team members are very important.<br>2. Rich skill system, with more than 100 skills in the game. Each banshee can learn other skills besides her own. So you can match the ever-changing skill combination according to your preference.<br>3. Map exploration. With the improvement of lock level, you can unlock higher level maps to obtain better banshees.<br>4. Divine beast system. Divine beast is not limited by carrying level, but it is not easy to obtain. You need to challenge a difficult task to get it.<br>5. Exchange system. Unwanted skill books can be exchanged for advanced skill books in the store.<br>6. The banshee attribute system has five attributes, including strength, magic, physique, endurance and speed. These attributes are very important for strength improvement.<br>7. Qualification system. The qualification of the banshee also determines her growth. The higher the qualification is, the higher the attribute will be obtained after upgrading.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2255480/extras/340e558a4adf5a9484e865ff45a471ed.avif?t=1693084758\" /></span>",
